#!medusa-plugin 1
# A long unattended watch: sweep slowly, wait, repeat. Written to be left
# running rather than watched.
id quiet-hours
name Quiet Hours Watch
author hartle-tech
version 1
needs rx,storage

> log starting a long watch
> repeat 20
>   sweep 1 13 1000
>   wait 30000
> end
> log watch complete
